::kind(writ)

=[ Writ: ambiguous fixture ]

==[ crate-layering ]

Every workspace member belongs to exactly *one* layer.

@rule(crate-layering){
  guard: { twrit: layers }

  layers: {
    1: list("thing*")
    0: list("thing")
  }
}

`thing` matches both patterns. Taking whichever was declared first would
make the layer order depend on the writ's line order, so it is reported.
